-- title:
--   Normalized monotone tensor characters
-- statement:
--   A tensor character assigns a real value to each finite coefficient tensor. It is normalized on the scalar multiplication tensor, additive under direct sum, multiplicative under tensor product, and monotone under linear restriction.
--
--   The structure records these laws together with the unit and diagonal scalar tensors. It specifies what a character is; existence is established separately.
